{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05240","headline":"明月 · 李如璧","name":"明月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三五月华流炯光，可怜怀归郢路长。\n逾江越汉津无梁，遥遥永夜思茫茫。\n昭君失宠辞上宫，蛾眉婵娟卧毡穹。\n胡人琵琶弹北风，汉家音信绝南鸿。\n昭君此时怨画工，可怜明月光[朣]胧。\n节既秋兮天向寒，沅有漪兮湘有澜。\n沅湘糺合淼漫漫，洛阳才子忆长安。\n可怜明月复团团，逐臣恋主心愈恪。\n弃妻思君情不薄，已悲芳岁徒沦落。\n复恐红颜坐销铄，可怜明月方照灼，向影倾身比葵藿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李如璧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}